+| Invariant | Where it's enforced | Test |
+|---|---|---|
+| Imposter count starts at one, stacks to cap | `rules.js` `maybeOutbreak` | invariants 1 |
+| Sacrifice is idempotent | `legal.js` `canSacrifice`, intent ids in `core.js` | invariants 2 |
